    "before": "Valid BYBLOCK group 62 value 0 on the parent, coordinate vertex or face was refused even when colors were disabled.",
    "after": "These BYBLOCK values are accepted for bounded geometry only when source colors are disabled; color-preserving imports still refuse them. Negative values, which may encode visibility, and malformed, duplicate or out-of-range color tags continue to be refused; subsequent valid objects survive."
  },
